            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "Addictive Match-3 game with exciting levels and super-cute graphics! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWho doesn't like Match-3 games? That's exactly what 'Clover Tale' is about. Get ready for pure amusement and peek into an amazing fairy-tale world! <br />\r\nExplore a beautiful world, complete quests, unlock new levels and gather collections! There's always something going on in the Nifflings' Valley. Sometimes it's funny, other times very dangerous. Even now, when everything seems so perfect, a black mist approaches their lands. What will happen to the peaceful valley of the Nifflings? Only you can solve all the mysteries and save the Valley!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n• 10 challenging game modes! <br />\r\n• Over 200 exciting quests! <br />\r\n• A vast world to explore! <br />\r\n• User-friendly interface! <br />\r\n• Free to play!",
